 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Added the ACP extension method `_session/steering`, advertised by `initialize` as `_meta.steering`, so a client can send a message into a turn that is already running: it is injected as a steer (the same queueing as typing while the agent works) instead of cancelling the turn the way a second `session/prompt` does. The agent answers `{ outcome: "injected" }`, or `{ outcome: "promptRequired" }` when nothing is running, in which case the client sends an ordinary `session/prompt`
+
 ## [18.11.1] - 2026-10-15
 
 ### Added
